# hxroot

> Modern fakechroot+fakeroot re-implementation with automatic proot fallback for Termux glibc.
> More information: https://github.com/Neltharion01/hxroot

- Run a command inside hxroot:
  hxroot {{command}}

- Convert absolute symlinks in rootfs prior to use:
  hxconvert {{rootfs_path}}

- Revert absolute symlink conversion:
  hxunconvert {{rootfs_path}}
